*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD PROCESS FLERETN-PREMAP VERSION 1
    MODULE SOURCE FOLLOWS
    MOVE SPACES TO WK-MSG.
    IF WK-VEHID EQ SPACES
        DO.
        MOVE 'ENTER VEHICLE ID' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    MOVE WK-VEHID TO VH-VEHID.
    OBTAIN CALC VEHICLE.
    IF DB-REC-NOT-FOUND
        DO.
        MOVE 'VEHICLE NOT ON FILE' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    OBTAIN LAST ASSIGNMENT WITHIN VEH-ASSIGN.
    IF DB-END-OF-SET
        DO.
        MOVE 'VEHICLE NEVER ASSIGNED' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    OBTAIN OWNER WITHIN EMP-ASSIGN.
    DISPLAY.
    MSEND.
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD PROCESS FLERETN-ENTER VERSION 1
    MODULE SOURCE FOLLOWS
    MOVE WK-VEHID TO VH-VEHID.
    OBTAIN CALC VEHICLE.
    OBTAIN LAST ASSIGNMENT WITHIN VEH-ASSIGN.
    IF AS-END NE 0
        DO.
        MOVE 'ALREADY RETURNED' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    IF WK-RETDT LT AS-STRT
        DO.
        MOVE 'RETURN DATE BEFORE START' TO WK-MSG.
        DISPLAY.
        END.
    MOVE WK-RETDT TO AS-END.
    MODIFY ASSIGNMENT.
    IF EMP-VEHICLE MEMBER
        DISCONNECT VEHICLE FROM EMP-VEHICLE.
    COMMIT.
    MOVE 'CAR RETURNED' TO WK-MSG.
    MOVE SPACES TO WK-VEHID.
    DISPLAY.
    MSEND.
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD PROCESS FLERETN-PF3 VERSION 1
    MODULE SOURCE FOLLOWS
    MOVE SPACES TO WK-VEHID.
    TRANSFER CONTROL TO 'FLEMENU' NOFINISH.
    MSEND.
